Package: ttk
Title: Wrapper for 'TTK' the Topology Toolkit
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Christophe", "Regouby", role = c("aut", "cph", "cre"), email = "christophe.regouby@free.fr")
Description: Provides R bindings to the Topology Toolkit (TTK) C++ library
    for topological data analysis on 3D meshes. Wraps core TTK algorithms
    including critical points, persistence diagrams, contour trees, merge trees,
    and Morse-Smale complexes as R functions operating on mesh3d objects.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
