Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: TTK (>= 1.4.0), C++17
LinkingTo: 
    Rcpp
Imports: 
    Rcpp, rgl
Suggests: 
    phutil,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
